# Build context is the repo ROOT for every service (compose `context: .`), so
# THIS root file is the only .dockerignore Docker reads — per-service ones are
# ignored. Keep host-only artifacts out of the image: a copied-in node_modules
# would clobber the one `bun install` builds, breaking the @robotmoney/contract
# `file:` symlink at runtime (Cannot find module). It also bloats the context.
**/node_modules
.git
**/.git
*.log
.env
.env.*
dist
**/dist
.DS_Store
